hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"690.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the people of knowledge did not disapprove of people fasting using tooth-sticks at any hour of the day in Ramadan"
"690.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the people of knowledge did not disapprove of people fasting using tooth-sticks at any hour of the day in Ramadan"
"691.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that when A'isha was doing itikaf she would only ask after sick people if she was walking and not if she was standing still. Malik said"
"691.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that when A'isha was doing itikaf she would only ask after sick people if she was walking and not if she was standing still. Malik said"
"692.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab whether someone doing itikaf could go into a house to relieve himself"
"692.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab whether someone doing itikaf could go into a house to relieve himself"
"693.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Nafi"
"693.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Nafi"
"694.1","[694] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, on the authority of Al-Sa’ib ibn Yazid, that he said: I was a boy working with Abdullah Ibn Utbah Ibn Masoud was in the market of Medina during the time of Omar Ibn Al-Khattab. We used to take from the Nabataean ashram a mat for Imam Malik, Hadith: 694 Arabic Hadith:"
"694.2","[694] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, on the authority of Al-Sa’ib ibn Yazid, that he said: I was a boy working with Abdullah Ibn Utbah Ibn Masoud was in the market of Medina during the time of Omar Ibn Al-Khattab. We used to take from the Nabataean ashram a mat for Imam Malik, Hadith: 694 Arabic Hadith:"
"695.1","[695] He told me on the authority of Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab on what basis he took Umar ibn al-Khattab from the Nabataean tribe, Ibn Shihab said: This was taken from them during the pre-Islamic era, so Omar obligated them to do so. Muwatta Imam Malik Hadith: 695 Arabic Hadith:"
"695.2","[695] He told me on the authority of Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab on what basis he took Umar ibn al-Khattab from the Nabataean tribe, Ibn Shihab said: This was taken from them during the pre-Islamic era, so Omar obligated them to do so. Muwatta Imam Malik Hadith: 695 Arabic Hadith:"
"696.1","Malik was asked whether someone who went into a mosque to do itikaf for the last ten days of Ramadan and stayed there for a day or two but then became ill and left the mosque"
"696.2","Malik was asked whether someone who went into a mosque to do itikaf for the last ten days of Ramadan and stayed there for a day or two but then became ill and left the mosque"
"697.1",""
"697.2",""
"698.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"698.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"699.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"699.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"700.1","And he related to me from Malik, from Nafi', that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say: He fasts the missed days of Ramadan consecutively if he broke his fast due to illness or travel."
"700.2","And he related to me from Malik, from Zayd ibn Aslam, from Iyad ibn Abdullah ibn Sa'd ibn Abi Sarh al-'Amiri, that he heard Abu Sa'id al-Khudri saying: We used to give the Zakat al-Fitr as one sa' of food, or one sa' of barley, or one sa' of dates, or one sa' of dried yogurt (aqit), or one sa' of raisins, and that was with the sa' of the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace."
"701.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil that 'Anas ibn Malik said"
"701.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil that 'Anas ibn Malik said"
"702.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn 'Umar that some of the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"702.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn 'Umar that some of the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"703.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard a man he trusted of the people of knowledge say"
"703.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard a man he trusted of the people of knowledge say"
"704.1","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"704.2","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
